{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜多雲初時有微雨　日間漸轉天晴乾燥\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORCAST-261029-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】一股清勁至強風程度的東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。本港地區今日(10月29日)天氣預測，大致多雲。初時有一兩陣微雨。日間漸轉天晴及乾燥，最高氣溫約29度。吹和緩至清勁東風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p>展望未來一兩日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.117128+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T23:02:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T02:18:11.636450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T23:38:32.673667+00:00","content_hash":"13ff6b482e23f66901749a607ef69ada2ebf784b4a6f3879a8944b2c9a72b859","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T23:40:31.117128+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}